<title>SPAIN: Telefonica- BT/MCI deal doesn't affect Unisource.</title>
<headline>Telefonica- BT/MCI deal doesn't affect Unisource.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telefonica de Espana Chairman Juan Villalonga said on Friday that the group's new deal with British Telecom and MCI does not affect its deal with Unisource.</p>
<p>&quot;The deal with BT/MCI does not harm (the current deal with) Unisource,&quot; Chairman Juan Villalonga told Reuters.</p>
</text>
